organic shapes and glistening colors  these chairs and lamps are made from  methacrylate usually used to make  industrial products such as car  reflectors Yakupov or genie prefers to  make unique pieces out of it a dream  he's had since childhood when he  discovered the material in his father's  factory everything started from from a  day in which I was a little little boy  and I saw from the nose of this machine  coming out this material for the first  time and it was like a seam in my in my  brain in my imagination that slowly  slowly grow until the moment that I I  decided to change my life and to you  know to dedicate my career to using this  material the 48 year old has a studio in  Milan where he works on prototypes with  his team to make the pieces the granules  have to be melted at a temperature above  300 degrees Celsius then color is added  and the material is molded into shape  yes of course it is dangerous because  the material is very hot and you have  few seconds to move it and there is no  stamp and or anything so everything is  already done by hand Giacomo Puccini's  latest creation is the Jill Deppe chair  he designed it for the Italian high-end  furniture company aedra he has this name  because it's dedicated to GW Rd the  director of internal magazine which is  like second mom for me more or less it's  a fantastic woman she's the woman that  she invented the Salone del Mobile so  together we did most of 20 installation  from snakes of 64 metre long or you know  you'd really crazy project together  Puccini's work has been shown in dozens  of museums and galleries around the  world and every year he exhibits at the  Milan Furniture Fair this installation  was created for the 2012 for a solo  leader this installation at the Basilica  de Sant Ambrogio was entitled symbols  for genie also works together with  international architects and designs the  interiors of hotels museums and private  homes work I feel like to be a child and  I think that this is the right attitude  to develop any project so I play with  this material and imagining my world  from light to chair to table to  everything and all of it made from a  material that was originally only meant  for manufacturing car parts
 

